d: Destroy as many cards you control as possible, and if you do, Special Summon 1 \"SPYRAL Super Agent\" from your hand, Deck, or Graveyard.',NULL,2800,1200,8,'Fiend','LIGHT',NULL,'SPYRAL',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Maximum Crisis\", \"set_code\": \"MACR-EN086\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 35699, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/35699.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/35699.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/35699.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.26\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.24\", \"ebay_price\": \"3.00\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.70\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]'),(39015,'Assault Sentinel','Effect Monster','effect','You can Tribute this card; Special Summon 1 monster from your hand or Deck that specifically lists \"Assault Mode Activate\" in its text, except \"Assault Sentinel\", also you cannot Special Summon monsters from the Extra Deck for the rest of this turn, except Synchro Monsters. You can target 1 face-up monster you control; reveal 1 Synchro Monster in your Extra Deck, and if you do, the targeted monster\'s Type and Attribute become the same as the revealed monster\'s, until the end of this turn. You can only use each effect of \"Assault Sentinel\" once per turn.',NULL,1600,800,4,'Beast-Warrior','EARTH',NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Dark Neostorm\", \"set_code\": \"DANE-EN011\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 39015, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/39015.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/39015.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/39015.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.19\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.31\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.20\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.39\"}]'),(41546,'D/D Savant Thomas','Pendulum Effect Monster','effect_pendulum','[ Pendulum Effect ] \nDuring your Main Phase: You can add 1 face-up \"D/D\" Pendulum Monster from your Extra Deck to your hand. You can only use this effect of \"D/D Savant Thomas\" once per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nYou can target 1 \"D/D\" card in your Pendulum Zone; destroy that card, and if you do, Special Summon 1 Level 8 \"D/D/D\" monster from your Deck in Defense Position, but for the rest of this turn, its effects (if any) are negated, also any battle damage your opponent takes becomes halved. You can only use this effect of \"D/D Savant Thomas\" once per turn.','During your Main Phase: You can add 1 face-up \"D/D\" Pendulum Monster from your Extra Deck to your hand. You can only use this effect of \"D/D Savant Thomas\" once per turn.',1800,2600,8,'Fiend','DARK',6,'D/D',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"2017 Mega-Tin Mega Pack\", \"set_code\": \"MP17-EN065\", \"set_rarity\": \"Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(R)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Ghosts From the Past: The 2nd Haunting\", \"set_code\": \"GFP2-EN078\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.31\"}, {\"set_name\": \"The Dark Illusion\", \"set_code\": \"TDIL-EN010\", \"set_rarity\": \"Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(R)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 41546, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/41546.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/41546.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/41546.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.15\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.18\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.59\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.99\"}]'),(41777,'Gem-Enhancement','Trap Card','trap','Tribute 1 \"Gem-Knight\" monster, then target 1 \"Gem-Knight\" monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon that target from the Graveyard.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Normal',NULL,NULL,'Gem-',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Duel Terminal 5a\", \"set_code\": \"DT05-EN049\", \"set_rarity\": \"Duel Terminal Rare Parallel Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(DRPR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Hidden Arsenal 5: Steelswarm Invasion\", \"set_code\": \"HA05-EN029\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 41777, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/41777.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/41777.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/41777.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.17\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.29\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.99\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.39\"}]'),(43227,'Magnum the Reliever','Fusion Monster','fusion','1 monster Special Summoned from the Extra Deck + 1 monster in the hand\r\nYou can target 1 \"Polymerization\" Spell or \"Fusion\" Spell in your GY; place that card on the bottom of the Deck, then draw 1 card. When another card, or its effect, is activated (Quick Effect): You can banish 1 \"Polymerization\" Spell or \"Fusion\" Spell from your GY, then target 1 card on the field; destroy it. You can only use each effect of \"Magnum the Reliever\" once per turn.',NULL,2800,2000,8,'Fiend','LIGHT',NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Duelist Nexus\", \"set_code\": \"DUNE-EN036\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 43227, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/43227.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/43227.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/43227.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.27\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.60\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.50\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.00\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"1.49\"}]'),(44818,'Starry Knight Orbitael','Effect Monster','effect','(Quick Effect): You can target 1 LIGHT monster you control; Tribute it, and if you do, Set 1 \"Starry Knight\" Spell/Trap directly from your Deck. If a face-up Level 7 LIGHT Dragon monster you control returns to the hand, while this card is in your GY (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon this card. You can only use each effect of \"Starry Knight Orbitael\" once per turn.',NULL,400,2100,4,'Fairy','LIGHT',NULL,'Starry Knight',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Burst of Destiny\", \"set_code\": \"BODE-EN027\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 44818, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/44818.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/44818.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/44818.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.07\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.08\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.97\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.49\"}]'),(50755,'Magician\'s Circle','Trap Card','trap','When a Spellcaster monster declares an attack: Each player Special Summons 1 Spellcaster monster with 2000 or less ATK from their Deck in Attack Position.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Normal',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Champion Pack: Game Four\", \"set_code\": \"CP04-EN011\", \"set_rarity\": \"Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(R)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Legendary Collection 3: Yugi\'s World Mega Pack\", \"set_code\": \"LCYW-EN100\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Legendary Decks II\", \"set_code\": \"LDK2-ENY38\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.76\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Legendary Duelists: Season 3\", \"set_code\": \"LDS3-EN097\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0.93\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel Starter Decks: Destiny Masters\", \"set_code\": \"SS01-ENA16\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.42\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Spellcaster\'s Command Structure Deck\", \"set_code\": \"SDSC-EN035\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.73\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Structure Deck: Order of the Spellcasters\", \"set_code\": \"SR08-EN039\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\":