,'Fusion Monster','fusion','2 \"Dual Avatar\" monsters\r\nThis card gains the following effect(s), based on the original names of the materials used for its Fusion Summon. ● \"Dual Avatar - Empowered Kon-Gyo\": The ATK of your battling \"Dual Avatar\" monsters become 3000 during damage calculation only. ● \"Dual Avatar - Empowered Mitsu-Jaku\": Once per opponent\'s turn (Quick Effect): You can target 1 card on the field; banish it.\r\nIf this Fusion Summoned card is destroyed: You can Special Summon 1 \"Dual Avatar Fists - Yuhi\" and 1 \"Dual Avatar Feet - Kokoku\" from your Deck, and if you do, they cannot be destroyed by battle or card effects this turn.',NULL,0,0,4,'Warrior','LIGHT',NULL,'Dual Avatar',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Cyberstorm Access\", \"set_code\": \"CYAC-EN038\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 28798938, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/28798938.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/28798938.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/28798938.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.08\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.05\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.00\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]'),(28803166,'Lacrima the Crimson Tears','Effect Monster','effect','(This card is always treated as a \"Fiendsmith\" card.)\r\nIf this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can send 1 \"Fiendsmith\" card from your Deck to the GY, except \"Lacrima the Crimson Tears\". During your opponent\'s turn, if this card is in your GY (Quick Effect): You can target 1 \"Fiendsmith\" Link Monster in your GY; shuffle this card into the Deck, and if you do, Special Summon that monster. You can only use each effect of \"Lacrima the Crimson Tears\" once per turn.',NULL,1200,1200,4,'Fiend','LIGHT',NULL,'Fiendsmith',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"2025 Mega-Pack Tin\", \"set_code\": \"MP25-EN100\", \"set_rarity\": \"Prismatic Secret Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(PScR)\", \"set