rd points to with card effects, and those monsters cannot be destroyed by battle.',NULL,1900,NULL,0,'Cyberse','LIGHT',NULL,NULL,2,'[\"Left\", \"Right\"]','[{\"set_name\": \"Star Pack VRAINS\", \"set_code\": \"SP18-EN033\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Star Pack VRAINS\", \"set_code\": \"SP18-EN033\", \"set_rarity\": \"Starfoil\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Star Pack VRAINS\", \"set_code\": \"SP18-EN033\", \"set_rarity\": \"Starfoil Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SFR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.31\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Starter Deck: Link Strike\", \"set_code\": \"YS17-EN042\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 34472920, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/34472920.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/34472920.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/34472920.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.06\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.11\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.49\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]'),(34475451,'Construction Train Signal Red','Effect Monster','effect','When an opponent\'s monster declares an attack: You can Special Summon this card from your hand, and if you do, change the attack target to this card and proceed to damage calculation. This card cannot be destroyed by that battle.',NULL,1000,1300,3,'Machine','EARTH',NULL,'Train',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Dragons of Legend\", \"set_code\": \"DRLG-EN038\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.43\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Dragons of Legend: The Complete Series\", \"set_code\": \"DLCS-EN040\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.05\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Legendary Duelists: Sisters of the Rose\", \"set_code\": \"LED4-EN043\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"i