,'FIRE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"25th Anniversary Tin: Dueling Mirrors\", \"set_code\": \"MP24-EN370\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Duelist Nexus\", \"set_code\": \"DUNE-EN046\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 34481518, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/34481518.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/34481518.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/34481518.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.12\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.10\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.00\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.00\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]'),(34487429,'Ancient City - Rainbow Ruins','Spell Card','spell','You must have this many \"Crystal Beast\" cards in your Spell & Trap Card Zone to activate and to resolve these effects. ● 1+: This card cannot be destroyed by card effects. ● 2+: Once per turn (including the opponent\'s) you can halve the Battle Damage you take. ● 3+: During either player\'s turn, when a Spell/Trap Card is activated: You can send 1 \"Crystal Beast\" monster you control to the Graveyard; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy it. ● 4+: Once per turn, during your Main Phase: You can draw 1 card. ● 5: Once per turn, during your Main Phase: You can target 1 \"Crystal Beast\" card in your Spell & Trap Card Zone; Special Summon that target.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Field',NULL,NULL,'Crystal Beast',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Battle Pack Tournament Prize Cards\", \"set_code\": \"BATT-EN006\", \"set_rarity\": \"Starfoil Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SFR)\", \"set_price\": \"28.8\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Duelist Pack: Jesse Anderson\", \"set_code\": \"DP07-EN017\", \"set_rarity\": \"Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(R)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Force of the Breaker\", \"set_code\": \"FOTB-EN045\", \"set_rarity\": \"Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(R)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\