gate the activation, and if you do, shuffle that card into the Deck.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Counter',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Dragons of Legend\", \"set_code\": \"DRLG-EN035\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.44\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Dragons of Legend: The Complete Series\", \"set_code\": \"DLCS-EN037\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"2.05\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Dragons of Legend: Unleashed\", \"set_code\": \"DRL3-EN054\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Duel Devastator\", \"set_code\": \"DUDE-EN054\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.6\"}, {\"set_name\": \"OTS Tournament Pack 2\", \"set_code\": \"OP02-EN027\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 34507039, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/34507039.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/34507039.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/34507039.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.22\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.25\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.25\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.25\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]'),(34522216,'Amorphage Gluttony','Pendulum Effect Monster','effect_pendulum','[ Pendulum Effect ] \nWhile you control an \"Amorphage\" monster, monsters cannot activate their effects, except \"Amorphage\" monsters. Once per turn, during your Standby Phase, Tribute 1 monster or destroy this card.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nIf this card is Pendulum Summoned or flipped face-up, neither player can Special Summon monsters from the Extra Deck while this card is face-up on the field, except \"Amorphage\" monsters.','While you control an \"Amorphage\" monster, monsters cannot activate their effects, except \"Amorphage\" monsters. Once per turn, during your Standby Phase, Tribute 1 monster or destroy this card.',0,185