rom your hand in Defense Position, and if you do, that monster gains 300 ATK. You can only use this effect of \"Evil HERO Vicious Claws\" once per turn. If a monster(s) you control is destroyed by battle or card effect, while this card is in your GY: You can Special Summon this card, then if you have a monster that mentions \"Dark Fusion\" in your GY, you can destroy 1 card on the field. You can only use this effect of \"Evil HERO Vicious Claws\" once per Duel.',NULL,2500,2500,7,'Fiend','DARK',NULL,'Evil HERO',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Alliance Insight\", \"set_code\": \"ALIN-EN005\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 35095329, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/35095329.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/35095329.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/35095329.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.06\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.05\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.00\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.00\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.00\"}]'),(35098357,'Witchcrafter Confusion Confession','Spell Card','spell','Fusion Summon 1 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, using monsters from your hand or field as material, including a \"Witchcrafter\" monster. During your End Phase, if you control a \"Witchcrafter\" monster while this card is in your GY: You can add this card to your hand. You can only use 1 \"Witchcrafter Confusion Confession\" effect per turn, and only once that turn.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Normal',NULL,NULL,'Witchcrafter',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Magnificent Mavens\", \"set_code\": \"MAMA-EN021\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 35098357, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/35098357.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/35098357.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/35098357.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.18\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.32\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.50\", \"amazon_