Xyz Summon. Transfer its materials to the Summoned monster.) During your Draw Phase, if this card is in your GY, instead of conducting your normal draw: You can add this card from your GY to your hand. You cannot Special Summon during the turn you activate this effect, except by the effect of \"Rank-Up-Magic Astral Force\".',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Normal',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"2014 Mega-Tin Mega Pack\", \"set_code\": \"MP14-EN226\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"25th Anniversary Tin: Dueling Mirrors\", \"set_code\": \"MP24-EN035\", \"set_rarity\": \"Quarter Century Secret Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Legacy of the Valiant\", \"set_code\": \"LVAL-EN059\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultimate Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UtR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Legacy of the Valiant\", \"set_code\": \"LVAL-EN059\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Premium Gold: Return of the Bling\", \"set_code\": \"PGL2-EN060\", \"set_rarity\": \"Gold Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(GUR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"The Infinity Chasers\", \"set_code\": \"INCH-EN044\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.54\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Wing Raiders\", \"set_code\": \"WIRA-EN055\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 45950291, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/45950291.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/45950291.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/45950291.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.10\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.14\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.40\", \"amazon_price\": \"1.00\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]'),(45951104,'Bot Herder','Spell Card','spell','Target 1 monster your opponent controls, that is a face-up monster you own or a face-down Defense Position monster; if that monster is no longer on the field, or is a monster you own (if face-down, reveal it briefly to check), apply these effects in sequence.\r\n● Inflict 200 damage to your opponent.\r\n● Take control of all monsters your opponent controls, except that monster.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Normal',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"2025 Mega-Pack Tin\", \"set_code\": \"MP25-EN149\", \"set_rarity\": \"Prismatic Secret Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(PScR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 45951104, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/45951104.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/45951104.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/45951104.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"1.19\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"2.28\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.00\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.00\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.00\"}]');
INSERT INTO `card` VALUES (45955628,'Catoblepas, Familiar of the Evil Eye','Effect Monster','effect','You can target 1 \"Evil Eye\" Spell/Trap you control; once, until the end of the next turn, that card cannot be destroyed by your opponent\'s card effects. If you control an \"Evil Eye\" monster other than \"Catoblepas, Familiar of the Evil Eye\", while this card is in your GY: You can Special Summon this card, but banish it when it leaves the field. You can only use each effect of \"Catoblepas, Familiar of the Evil Eye\" once per turn.',NULL,600,1900,3,'Fiend','DARK',NULL,'Evil Eye',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"2020 Tin of Lost Memories Mega Pack\", \"set_code\": \"MP20-EN234\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.04\"}, {\"set_name\": \"The Infinity Chasers\", \"set_code\": \"INCH-EN029\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 45955628, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/45955628.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/45955628.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/45955628.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.05\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.16\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.25\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]'),(45960523,'Metaphys Daedalus','Effect Monster','effect','If this card is Special Summoned by the effect of a \"Metaphys\" monster: You can banish all other face-up Special Summoned monsters on the field. If this card is banished, during the Standby Phase of the next turn: You can shuffle this banished card into the Deck; banish 1 \"Metaphys\" card from your Deck, except \"Metaphys Daedalus\".',NULL,2600,1500,7,'Wyrm','LIGHT',NULL,'Metaphys',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Circuit Break\", \"set_code\": \"CIBR-EN024\", \"set_rarity\": \"Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(R)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 45960523, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/45960523.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/45960523.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/45960523.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.31\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.25\", \"ebay_price\": \"4.98\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.60\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.99\"}]'),(45974017,'Dark Contract with the Yamimakai','Spell Card','spell','Once per turn, during your Standby Phase: Take 1000 damage.\nYou can only use 1 of the following effects of \"Dark Contract with the Yamimakai\" per turn, and only once that turn.\n● During your Main Phase: You can target 1 \"D/D\" Pendulum Monster in your Graveyard; place it in your Pendulum Zone.\n● During your Main Phase: You can place 1 face-up \"D/D\" Pendulum Monster from your Extra Deck in your Pendulum Zone.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Continuous',NULL,NULL,'D/D',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Pendulum Domination Structure Deck\", \"set_code\": \"SDPD-EN023\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 45974017, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/45974017.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/45974017.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/45974017.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.11\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.23\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.75\", \"amazon_price\": \"1.00\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]'),(45985838,'Solar Flare Dragon','Effect Monster','effect','While you control another Pyro-Type monster, this card cannot be attacked. During each of your End Phases: Inflict 500 damage to your opponent.',NULL,1500,1000,4,'Pyro','FIRE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Ancient Sanctuary\", \"set_code\": \"AST-032\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.84\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Dark Revelation Volume 2\", \"set_code\": \"DR2-EN144\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Gold Series\", \"set_code\": \"GLD1-EN019\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\",