 to that monster also become Xyz Materials on this card.) This card gains 1000 ATK for each Xyz Material attached to it. Once per turn: You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card; destroy all Defense Position monsters your opponent controls.',NULL,500,500,6,'Aqua','WATER',NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Premium Gold: Return of the Bling\", \"set_code\": \"PGL2-EN018\", \"set_rarity\": \"Gold Secret Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(GScR)\", \"set_price\": \"2.13\"}]','[{\"id\": 57707471, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/57707471.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/57707471.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/57707471.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"1.94\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"1.21\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.74\", \"amazon_price\": \"4.95\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"1.49\"}]'),(57722593,'Konohanasakuya','Spirit Monster','effect','Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned (from your hand) by controlling a Spirit monster. You can only Special Summon \"Konohanasakuya\" once per turn this way. Once per turn, during the End Phase, if this card was Special Summoned this turn: Return it to the hand. Once per turn, during the End Phase: You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 Spirit monster you control; neither player can activate that face-up monster\'s effects on the field for the rest of this turn.',NULL,1300,1300,3,'Fairy','EARTH',NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Dawn of Majesty\", \"set_code\": \"DAMA-EN027\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.04\"}]','[{\"id\": 57722593, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/57722593.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/57722593.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/57722593.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.09\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.08\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"14.84\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.49\"}]'),(57728570,'Crush Card Virus','Trap Card','tra