mmon\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Structure Deck: Seto Kaiba\", \"set_code\": \"SDKS-EN031\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.31\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Turbo Pack: Booster One\", \"set_code\": \"TU01-EN006\", \"set_rarity\": \"Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(R)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 57728570, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/57728570.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/57728570.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/57728570.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.12\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.28\", \"ebay_price\": \"4.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"4.86\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.39\"}]'),(57731460,'Gladiator Beast Equeste','Effect Monster','effect','When this card is Special Summoned by the effect of a \"Gladiator Beast\" monster: Target 1 \"Gladiator Beast\" card in your Graveyard; add that target to your hand. At the end of the Battle Phase, if this card attacked or was attacked: You can shuffle it into the Deck; Special Summon 1 \"Gladiator Beast\" monster from your Deck, except \"Gladiator Beast Equeste\".',NULL,1600,1200,4,'Winged Beast','WIND',NULL,'Gladiator Beast',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Legendary Collection 2: The Duel Academy Years Mega Pack\", \"set_code\": \"LCGX-EN251\", \"set_rarity\": \"Secret Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(ScR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"OTS Tournament Pack 12 (POR)\", \"set_code\": \"OP12-PT032\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0.00\"}, {\"set_name\": \"The Duelist Genesis\", \"set_code\": \"TDGS-EN024\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 57731460, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/57731460.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/57731460.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/57731460.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"1.53\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"2.00\", \"ebay_price\": \"11.00\", \"amazon_price\": \"10.14\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.99\"}]'),(57734012,'Rank-Up-Magic - The Seventh One','Spell Card','spell','To activate this card, you must draw it for your normal draw in your Draw Phase, reveal it, and keep it revealed until the start of Main Phase 1. At the start of your Main Phase 1 that same turn, you can: Special Summon, from your Extra Deck or Graveyard, 1 monster that has a number between \"Number 101\" and \"Number 107\" in its name, except \"Number C\" monsters, then Xyz Summon, from your Extra Deck, 1 \"Number C\" monster with the same number in its name as the first monster, by using it as the Xyz Material. You can only apply the effect of \"Rank-Up-Magic - The Seventh One\" once per Duel.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Normal',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"2015 Mega-Tin Mega Pack\", \"set_code\": \"MP15-EN033\", \"set_rarity\": \"Secret Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(ScR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Legendary Duelists: Duels From the Deep\", \"set_code\": \"LED9-EN014\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.01\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Maximum Gold\", \"set_code\": \"MAGO-EN049\", \"set_rarity\": \"Premium Gold Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(PG)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"OTS Tournament Pack 15\", \"set_code\": \"OP15-EN020\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.11\"}, {\"set_name\": \"OTS Tournament Pack 15 (POR)\", \"set_code\": \"OP15-PT020\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Primal Origin\", \"set_code\": \"PRIO-EN058\", \"set_rarity\": \"Secret Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(ScR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 57734012, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/57734012.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/57734012.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/57734012.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.05\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.08\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.19\", \"amazon_price\": \"1.95\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.39\"}]'),(57736667,'Mikanko Dance - Mayowashidori','Spell Card','spell','The equipped monster cannot be destroyed by card effects. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Mikanko Dance - Mayowashidori\" once per turn. At the end of the Damage Step, if your \"Mikanko\" monster battled: You can target 1 card on the field; return it to the hand. If this card is in your GY: You can target 1 \"Mikanko\" monster in your GY; Special Summon it, and if you do, equip it with this card, but banish it when it leaves the field.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Equip',NULL,NULL,'Mikanko',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"25th Anniversary Tin: Dueling Mirrors\", \"set_code\": \"MP24-EN348\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Cyberstorm Access\", \"set_code\": \"CYAC-EN062\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 57736667, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/57736667.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/57736667.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/57736667.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.10\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.11\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.00\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]'),(57753602,'Gem Flash Energy','Trap Card','trap','During each of your Standby Phases, inflict damage to your opponent equal to the number of face-up Continuous Spell Cards on the field x 300.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Continuous',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Force of the Breaker\", \"set_code\": \"FOTB-EN059\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 57753602, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/57753602.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/57753602.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/57753602.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.09\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.20\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"1.18\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]'),(57761191,'Metaltron XII, the True Dracombatant','Effect Monster','effect','Requires 3 Tributes to Normal Summon (cannot be Normal Set). To Tribute Summon this card face-up, you can Tribute Continuous Spell/Trap Card(s) you control, as well as monsters. Unaffected by the effects of cards with the same card type (Monster, Spell, and/or Trap) as the original card type of the cards Tributed for its Tribute Summon. If this Tribute Summoned monster in its owner\'s control is destroyed by an opponent\'s card (by battle or card effect): You can Special Summon 1 Fusion, Synchro, or Xyz Monster that is EARTH, WATER, FIRE, or WIND from your Extra Deck.',NULL,3000,3000,9,'Wyrm','LIGHT',NULL,'True Draco',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Maximum Crisis\", \"set_code\": \"MACR-EN025\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 57761191, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/57761191.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/57761191.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/57761191.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.28\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.25\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.55\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.65\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]'),(57769391,'Altergeist Pixiel','Effect Monster','effect','You can Tribute this card; excavate the top 3 cards of your Deck, add 1 excavated \"Altergeist\" card to your hand, also send the rest to the GY. You can only use this effect of \"Altergeist Pixiel\" once per turn.',NULL,100,100,1,'Spellcaster','WIND',NULL,'Altergeist',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"2019 Gold Sarcophagus Tin Mega Pack\", \"set_code\": \"MP19-EN010\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Flames of Destruction\", \"set_code\": \"FLOD-EN015\", \"set_rarity\": \"Commo