ika Fleurdelis, the Knighted','Effect Monster','effect','During the Main Phase, if a monster Special Summoned from the Extra Deck is on the field (Quick Effect): You can Special Summon this card from your hand, then, if you control another \"Dogmatika\" monster, you can negate the effects of 1 face-up monster on the field, until the end of this turn. When your \"Dogmatika\" monster declares an attack: You can make all \"Dogmatika\" monsters you currently control gain 500 ATK. You can only use each effect of \"Dogmatika Fleurdelis, the Knighted\" once per turn.',NULL,2500,2500,8,'Spellcaster','LIGHT',NULL,'Dogmatika',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"2021 Tin of Ancient Battles\", \"set_code\": \"MP21-EN104\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Rise of the Duelist\", \"set_code\": \"ROTD-EN008\", \"set_rarity\": \"Secret Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(ScR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Structure Deck: Albaz Strike\", \"set_code\": \"SDAZ-EN006\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.26\"}]','[{\"id\": 69680031, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/69680031.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/69680031.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/69680031.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.10\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.12\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.74\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.25\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]'),(69695704,'Battlestorm','Effect Monster','effect','This card gains 100 ATK for each Winged Beast-Type monster you control. Once per turn: You can target 1 Spell/Trap Card your opponent controls; destroy that target. You must control 3 or more Winged Beast-Type monsters to activate and to resolve this effect.',NULL,1700,1000,4,'Winged Beast','DARK',NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Battle Pack 3: Monster League\", \"set_code\": \"BP03-EN055\", \"set_rarity\": \"Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(R)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Battle Pack 3: Monster League\", \"set_code\": \"BP03-EN055\", \"set_rarity\": \"Shatterfoil Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SHR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Raging Battle\", \"set_code\": \"RGBT-EN000\", \"set_rarity\": \"Secret Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(ScR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Raging Battle Sneak Peek Participation Card\", \"set_code\": \"RGBT-ENSP1\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"4.57\"}]','[{\"id\": 69695704, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/69695704.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/69695704.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/69695704.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.10\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.18\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.25\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]');
INSERT INTO `card` VALUES (69700783,'Vampire\'s Desire','Spell Card','spell','Activate 1 of these effects.\n● Target 1 face-up monster you control; send 1 \"Vampire\" monster from your Deck to the GY with a different Level from that monster, and if you do, the targeted monster becomes the Level of that sent monster in the GY, until the end of this turn.\n● Target 1 \"Vampire\" monster in your GY; send 1 monster you control to the GY, and if you do, Special Summon the targeted monster.\nYou can only activate 1 \"Vampire\'s Desire\" per turn.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Normal',NULL,NULL,'Vampire',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"2019 Gold Sarcophagus Tin Mega Pack\", \"set_code\": \"MP19-EN240\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Dark Saviors\", \"set_code\": \"DASA-EN008\", \"set_rarity\": \"Secret Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(ScR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel GX: Duelists of Shadows\", \"set_code\": \"SGX3-ENC18\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 69700783, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/69700783.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/69700783.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/69700783.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.06\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.20\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.25\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.49\"}]'),(69711728,'Metalfoes Combination','Trap Card','trap','Once per turn, if a Fusion Monster is Fusion Summoned: You can target 1 \"Metalfoes\" monster in your Graveyard with a lower Level than that Fusion Monster; Special Summon it. If this card is sent from the field to the Graveyard: You can add 1 \"Metalfoes\" monster from your Deck to your hand.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Continuous',NULL,NULL,'Metalfoes',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"2017 Mega-Tin Mega Pack\", \"set_code\": \"MP17-EN112\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(