 monster again in a row. At the end of the Battle Phase: You can pay half your Life Points, then target 2 cards in any Graveyard(s); place 1 of them on the top of the Deck, and if you do, attach the other to this card as an Xyz Material.',NULL,0,0,6,'Dragon','DARK',NULL,'Chaos',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Dragons of Legend\", \"set_code\": \"DRLG-EN043\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"2.62\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Dragons of Legend: The Complete Series\", \"set_code\": \"DLCS-EN045\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"2\"}]','[{\"id\": 69757518, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/69757518.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/69757518.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/69757518.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.16\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.19\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"1.28\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]'),(69761020,'S-Force Showdown','Spell Card','spell','Activate 1 of the following effects.\r\n● Special Summon 1 \"S-Force\" monster from your hand in Defense Position.\r\n● Target 1 \"S-Force\" monster in your GY; add it to your hand.\r\nYou can only activate 1 \"S-Force Showdown\" per turn.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Quick-Play',NULL,NULL,'S-Force',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Blazing Vortex\", \"set_code\": \"BLVO-EN058\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 69761020, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/69761020.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/69761020.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/69761020.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.07\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.08\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.25\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]'),(69764158,'Peropero Cerperus','Effect Monster','effect','If you take damage by battle or an opponent\'s card effect while this card is in the GY: You can banish this card from the GY, then target 1 card on the field; destroy it.',NULL,0,1800,3,'Beast','EARTH',NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Premium Gold: Return of the Bling\", \"set_code\": \"PGL2-EN008\", \"set_rarity\": \"Gold Secret Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(GScR)\", \"set_price\": \"2.27\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Structure Deck: Shaddoll Showdown\", \"set_code\": \"SDSH-EN022\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.1\"}]','[{\"id\": 69764158, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/69764158.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/69764158.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/69764158.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.09\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.10\", \"ebay_price\": \"2.25\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.92\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.49\"}]'),(69780745,'Garvas','Normal Monster','normal','\'\'A wicked beast that resembles a winged lion.\'\'',NULL,2000,1700,6,'Beast','EARTH',NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','null','[{\"id\": 69780745, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/69780745.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/69780745.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/69780745.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.00\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.00\", \"ebay_price\": \"10.68\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.20\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.00\"}]'),(69792699,'Penguin Sword','Spell Card','spell','Equip only to a \"Penguin\" monster. It gains 800 ATK. When the equipped monster inflicts battle damage to your opponent: You can return 1 card your opponent controls to the hand. If a face-up card your opponent controls leaves the field by a \"Penguin\" card\'s effect and returns to the hand or is banished: Negate the activated effects and effects on the field of cards with that original name, until the end of the next turn. You can only use this effect of \"Penguin Sword\" once per turn.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Equip',NULL,NULL,'Penguin',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Brothers of Legend\", \"set_code\": \"BROL-EN008\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.01\"}]','[{\"id\": 69792699, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/69792699.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/69792699.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/69792699.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.09\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.19\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.49\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.49\"}]'),(69802283,'Gathering Light','Spell Card','spell','You can banish 1 monster you control, and 1 Synchro Monster in your GY that is a \"Power Tool\" monster or Level 7 or 8 Dragon monster, then target 1 card your opponent controls; destroy it. Level 7 or higher Synchro Monsters you control gain 400 ATK for each of your banished Level 7 or higher Synchro Monsters. Once per turn, when an opponent\'s monster declares an attack while you have a banished Synchro Monster: You can negate the attack.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Continuous',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Battles of Legend: Terminal Revenge\", \"set_code\": \"BLTR-EN030\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 69802283, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/69802283.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/69802283.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/69802283.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.07\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.09\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.00\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.00\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.00\"}]'),(69809989,'Ghostrick Shot','Spell Card','spell','Special Summon 1 \"Ghostrick\" monster from your hand or GY, then you can change 1 face-down \"Ghostrick\" monster you control to face-up Attack Position. You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 \"Ghostrick\" Xyz Monster you control; attach 1 \"Ghostrick\" card from your GY to that monster as material. You can only use each effect of \"Ghostrick Shot\" once per turn.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Normal',NULL,NULL,'Ghostrick',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Battle of Chaos\", \"set_code\": \"BACH-EN057\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0.86\"}]','[{\"id\": 69809989, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/69809989.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/69809989.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/69809989.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.06\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.13\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.49\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]'),(69811710,'Girsu, the Orcust Mekk-Knight','Effect Monster','effect','If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can send 1 \"Orcust\" or \"World Legacy\" card from your Deck to the GY, then, if there are 2 or more other cards in this card\'s column, treat this card as a Tuner this turn. If you control no other monsters: You can Special Summon 1 \"World Legacy Token\" (Machine/DARK/Level 1/ATK 0/DEF 0) to both players\' fields in Defense Position. You can only use each effect of \"Girsu, the Orcust Mekk-Knight\" once per turn.',NULL,1800,0,4,'Machine','DARK',NULL,'Mekk-Knight',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"2021 Tin of Ancient Battles\", \"set_code\": \"MP21-EN056\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Battles of Legend: Monster Mayhem\", \"set_code\": \"BLMM-EN088\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Eternity Code\", \"set_code\": \"ETCO-EN024\", \"set_rarity\": \"Secret Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(ScR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Quarter Century Bonanza\", \"set_code\": \"RA03-EN026\", \"set_rarity\": \"Collector\'s Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(CR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Quarter Century Bonanza\", \"set_code\": \"RA03-EN026\", \"set_rarity\": \"Platinum Secret Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(PS)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Quart