rn.',5000,0,12,'Fairy','DARK',11,'Power Patron',NULL,'null','null','[{\"id\": 70488851, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/70488851.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/70488851.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/70488851.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.00\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.00\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.00\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.00\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.00\"}]'),(70491413,'Surprise Chain','Spell Card','spell','Activate only as Chain Link 2 or higher; apply the following effects, depending on the Chain Link number of this card, in sequence (skip over any that do not apply). You cannot activate this card if multiple cards/effects with the same name are in that Chain.\r\n● 2+: Excavate the top cards of your Deck, equal to the Chain Link number of this card, then place them on the top of your Deck in any order.\r\n● 3+: Send the top card of your Deck to the GY.\r\n● 4+: Draw 1 card.\r\nYou can only activate 1 \"Surprise Chain\" per turn.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Quick-Play',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Dimension Force\", \"set_code\": \"DIFO-EN068\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0.9\"}]','[{\"id\": 70491413, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/70491413.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/70491413.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/70491413.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.04\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.09\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.25\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.49\"}]'),(70491682,'Vendread Anima','Effect Monster','effect','You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 of your banished \"Vendread\" monsters, except \"Vendread Anima\"; Special Summon it, also you cannot Special Summon monsters for the rest of this turn, except Zombie monsters. A \"Vendread\" monster Ritual Summoned using this card on the field gains the following effect. You can only use each of the preceding effects 