rd. Once per turn: You can remove 5 or 7 Symphonic Counters from your field; apply this effect, depending on the number of Symphonic Counters removed.\r\n● 5 Counters: Inflict 300 damage to your opponent for each \"Symphonic Warrior\" card on the field.\r\n● 7 Counters: Banish cards your opponent controls and/or in their Graveyard, up to the number of \"Symphonic Warrior\" cards on the field.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Field',NULL,NULL,'Symphonic Warrior',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"2017 Mega-Tin Mega Pack\", \"set_code\": \"MP17-EN234\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"OTS Tournament Pack 19\", \"set_code\": \"OP19-EN026\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.79\"}, {\"set_name\": \"OTS Tournament Pack 19 (POR)\", \"set_code\": \"OP19-PT026\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Raging Tempest\", \"set_code\": \"RATE-EN092\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 75304793, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/75304793.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/75304793.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/75304793.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.02\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.05\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.25\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.49\"}]'),(75311421,'Votis','Effect Monster','effect','When this card is Normal Summoned: You can excavate the top 3 cards of your Deck, and if you do, you can banish 1 excavated monster to add 1 monster with its same name to your hand, from either your Deck or the other excavated cards, also shuffle the rest into the Deck. Once per turn, during the End Phase, if this card is in your GY because it was sent there this turn after being Normal Summoned/Set: You can excavate the top 3 cards of your Deck, and if you do, place them on top of the Deck in any order.',NULL,1700,1900,4,'Fiend','DARK',NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Cyberstorm Access\", \"set_code\": \"CYAC-EN094\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 75311421, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/75311421.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/75311421.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/75311421.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.07\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.11\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.00\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.49\"}]'),(75326861,'Dark Highlander','Synchro Monster','synchro','1 Fiend-Type Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner Fiend-Type monsters\nNeither player can Synchro Summon. Once per turn: You can target 1 monster your opponent controls that is equipped with an Equip Card; destroy all Equip Cards equipped to that monster, and if you do, inflict 400 damage to your opponent for each card destroyed.',NULL,2800,2300,7,'Fiend','DARK',NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Collectible Tins 2012 Wave 1\", \"set_code\": \"CT09-EN007\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"2.47\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Yu-Gi-Oh! 5D\'s Volume 1 promotional card\", \"set_code\": \"YF01-EN001\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"5.39\"}]','[{\"id\": 75326861, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/75326861.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/75326861.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/75326861.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.46\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.21\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.25\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]');
