\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 93612434, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/93612434.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/93612434.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/93612434.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.20\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.22\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.98\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.79\"}]'),(93655221,'Shield Handler','Trap Card','trap','When a card or effect is activated that would destroy a monster on the field (except during the Damage Step): Target 1 Link Monster on each field; negate the effects of your opponent\'s targeted monster, and if you do, equip this card to your targeted monster. The equipped monster cannot be destroyed by card effects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Normal',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"2019 Gold Sarcophagus Tin Mega Pack\", \"set_code\": \"MP19-EN125\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Cybernetic Horizon\", \"set_code\": \"CYHO-EN068\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 93655221, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/93655221.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/93655221.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/93655221.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.06\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.05\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.25\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.49\"}]'),(93657021,'Destiny HERO - Dusktopia','Fusion Monster','fusion','1 \"Destiny HERO\" Fusion Monster + 1 \"Destiny HERO\" monster\r\nIf this card is Fusion Summoned: You can Fusion Summon 1 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, using monsters from your hand or field as Fusion Material. Once per turn (Quick Effect): You can target 1 monster on the field; make it unable to be destroyed by battle or card effects, and if you do, neither player takes any battle damage from attacks involving t