 control is targeted for an attack: You can negate the attack. If this card is in the Graveyard: You can banish 1 other \"Cyber Angel\" monster from your Graveyard, then target 1 monster your opponent controls; Special Summon this card, and if you do, take control of that monster.',NULL,1000,1000,5,'Fairy','LIGHT',NULL,'Cyber Angel',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Raging Tempest\", \"set_code\": \"RATE-EN036\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 99427357, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/99427357.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/99427357.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/99427357.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"1.35\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.81\", \"ebay_price\": \"4.00\", \"amazon_price\": \"2.05\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"2.99\"}]'),(99429730,'Sylvan Guardioak','Effect Monster','effect','Once per turn: You can choose a number from 1 to 3, then excavate that many cards from the top of your Deck, send any excavated Plant-Type monsters to the Graveyard, also place the other cards on the bottom of your Deck in any order. If this card is excavated from the Deck and sent to the Graveyard by a card effect: You can target 1 other Plant-Type monster in your Graveyard; place that target on the top of your Deck.',NULL,2400,1500,6,'Plant','EARTH',NULL,'Sylvan',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"2014 Mega-Tin Mega Pack\", \"set_code\": \"MP14-EN200\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Legacy of the Valiant\", \"set_code\": \"LVAL-EN019\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}]','[{\"id\": 99429730, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/99429730.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/99429730.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/99429730.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.07\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.14\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.25\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.49\"}]'),(99456344,'Dramaturge of Despia','Effect Monster','effect','If a Fusion, Synchro, Xyz, or Link Monster is Special Summoned (except during the Damage Step): You can target 1 Effect Monster on the field; negate its effects until the end of this turn. If this card in your hand or field is used as Fusion Material, and sent to the GY or banished: You can Special Summon this card. You can only use each effect of \"Dramaturge of Despia\" once per turn.',NULL,3000,1500,8,'Fairy','DARK',NULL,'Despia',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"2022 Tin of the Pharaoh\'s Gods\", \"set_code\": \"MP22-EN124\", \"set_rarity\": \"Prismatic Secret Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(PScR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Dawn of Majesty\", \"set_code\": \"DAMA-EN007\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Ghosts From the Past: The 2nd Haunting\", \"set_code\": \"GFP2-EN098\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.72\"}]','[{\"id\": 99456344, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/99456344.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/99456344.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/99456344.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.18\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.18\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.44\", \"amazon_price\": \"2.29\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.79\"}]');
