1002,'Straight to the Grave','Skill Card','skill','[At the start of the Duel, place this card in your Field Zone and flip it over.]\r\n\r\nAll Dinosaur, Zombie, and Rock monsters on the field gain 200 ATK/DEF.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Bonz',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Arena of Lost Souls\", \"set_code\": \"SBLS-ENS02\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.53\"}]','[{\"id\": 300101002, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300101002.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300101002.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300101002.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.49\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.43\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.15\", \"amazon_price\": \"7.77\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.99\"}]'),(300101003,'Call of the Haunted (Skill Card)','Skill Card','skill','[At the start of the Duel, place this card in your center Spell & Trap Zone. You cannot activate this Skill during your first turn of the Duel. You draw 1 less card at the beginning of the Duel.] \r\n\r\nActivate this card by targeting 1 monster in your GY; Special Summon that target in Attack Position. When this card leaves the field, destroy that monster. When that monster is destroyed, destroy this card.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Bonz',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Arena of Lost Souls\", \"set_code\": \"SBLS-ENS03\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"2.58\"}]','[{\"id\": 300101003, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300101003.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300101003.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300101003.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.00\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.00\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.00\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.99\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.00\"}]'),(300101004,'Royal Flush','Skill Card','skill','[Flip this card over when you activate this Skill.]\r\n\r\nOnce per turn, if you control \"Queen\'s Knight\", you can pay 1000 LP to Normal Summon 1 \"King\'s Knight\" in addition to your Normal Summon or Set. \"King\'s Knight\" and \"Jack\'s Knight\" you control cannot attack directly the turn you use this Skill.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Yugi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Arena of Lost Souls\", \"set_code\": \"SBLS-ENS04\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.63\"}]','[{\"id\": 300101004, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300101004.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300101004.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300101004.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.42\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.51\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"1.77\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.99\"}]'),(300101005,'Tomb of the Pharaoh','Skill Card','skill','[At the start of the Duel, place this card in your Field Zone and flip it over.]\r\n\r\nThis card\'s name is always treated as \"Necrovalley\".\r\nAll \"Gravekeeper\'s\" monsters on the field gain 200 ATK/DEF.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Ishizu',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Arena of Lost Souls\", \"set_code\": \"SBLS-ENS05\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"3.05\"}]','[{\"id\": 300101005, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300101005.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300101005.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300101005.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"1.84\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.57\", \"ebay_price\": \"2.95\", \"amazon_price\": \"1.50\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"1.99\"}]'),(300102001,'The World\'s Greatest Fisherman','Skill Card','skill','[Flip this card over when you activate this Skill.]\r\n\r\nOnce per turn, you can pay 500 LP and discard 1 WATER monster, then add 1 WATER monster from your GY to your hand, with a different name and with a Level no more than twice the discarded monster\'s Level. If you do that, flip this card over.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Mako',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Attack from the Deep\", \"set_code\": \"SBAD-ENS01\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.47\"}]','[{\"id\": 300102001, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300102001.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300102001.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300102001.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"1.54\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.61\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.15\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.99\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"1.49\"}]'),(300102002,'Mythic Depths','Skill Card','skill','[At the start of the Duel, place this card in your Field Zone and flip it over.]\r\n\r\nAll Fish, Sea Serpent, Thunder, and Aqua monsters on the field gain 200 ATK/DEF. All Machine and Pyro monsters on the field lose 200 ATK/DEF. This card\'s name becomes \"Umi\" while on the field.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Mako',NULL,NULL,'Umi',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Attack from the Deep\", \"set_code\": \"SBAD-ENS02\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.77\"}]','[{\"id\": 300102002, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300102002.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300102002.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300102002.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.47\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.41\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.60\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.39\"}]'),(300102003,'Catch of the Day','Skill Card','skill','[Flip this card over when you activate this Skill.]\r\n\r\nIf you control \"The Legendary Fisherman\", you can activate \"Umi\" directly from your Deck or GY. This Skill can only be used once per Duel.\r\nOnce per turn, when \"The Legendary Fisherman\" you control destroys a monster by battle or inflicts battle damage to your opponent, you can Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower WATER monster from your Deck or GY in Defense Position.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Mako',NULL,NULL,'Umi',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel Tournament Pack 6\", \"set_code\": \"STP6-ENS02\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Attack from the Deep\", \"set_code\": \"SBAD-ENS03\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.12\"}]','[{\"id\": 300102003, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300102003.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300102003.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300102003.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.43\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.41\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.89\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.49\"}]'),(300102004,'It\'s My Lucky Day!','Skill Card','skill','[Flip this card over when you activate this Skill..]\r\n\r\nWhen you activate an effect that would make you roll a six-sided die (or dice) or flip a coin(s), you can pay 1000 LP to decide the result of 1 die or coin. This Skill can only be used once per Duel.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Joey',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Attack from the Deep\", \"set_code\": \"SBAD-ENS04\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"2.93\"}]','[{\"id\": 300102004, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300102004.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300102004.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300102004.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.81\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.56\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.50\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.60\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"1.49\"}]'),(300102005,'Viral Infection','Skill Card','skill','[Flip this card over when you activate this Skill.]\r\n\r\nOnce per turn, discard any number of cards and declare 1 type of card (Monster, Spell, or Trap). Your opponent sends 1 card of the declared type from their Deck to the GY for each discarded card. If you do that, flip this card over.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Kaiba',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Attack from the Deep\", \"set_code\": \"SBAD-ENS05\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"3.33\"}]','[{\"id\": 300102005, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300102005.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300102005.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300102005.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"1.53\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"2.07\", \"ebay_price\": \"4.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"4.64\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"2.99\"}]'),(300103001,'Heavy Metal Raiders (Skill Card)','Skill Card','skill','The first time each DARK Machine monster you control would be destroyed by battle each turn, it is not destroyed, and if you took battle damage from the battle, it gains that much ATK after damage calculation, and keeps that ATK gain as long as this card is on the field. Once per turn, if a monster you control that was originally a DARK Machine destroys a card(s) on the field by battle or card effect: You can Special Summon 1 DARK Machine monster from your hand. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Keith',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Scars of Battle\", \"set_code\": \"SBSC-ENS01\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"3.58\"}]','[{\"id\": 300103001, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300103001.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300103001.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300103001.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.00\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.00\", \"ebay_price\": \"7.00\", \"amazon_price\": \"3.37\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.00\"}]'),(300103002,'Spell Proof Armor','Skill Card','skill','[Activate this Skill during your Main Phase.] \r\n\r\nAll Machine monsters you control are unaffected by your opponent\'s Spell effects. You can Normal Summon Machine Normal Monsters with 1 less Tribute. If a non-Machine monster is in your GY, flip this Skill over. This Skill can only be used once per Duel.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Keith',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel Tournament Pack 4\", \"set_code\": \"STP4-ENS03\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"0\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Scars of Battle\", \"set_code\": \"SBSC-ENS02\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"7.22\"}]','[{\"id\": 300103002, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300103002.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300103002.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300103002.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"1.07\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"1.05\", \"ebay_price\": \"3.49\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.50\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"5.99\"}]'),(300103003,'Bandit','Skill Card','skill','If your LP are 1500 or less, activate this Skill. Take control of 1 Set card in your opponent\'s Spell & Trap Zone. This Skill can only be used once per Duel. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Keith',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Scars of Battle\", \"set_code\": \"SBSC-ENS03\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.7\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Scars of Battle Launch Event participation card\", \"set_code\": \"EVSD-ENS02\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"5.85\"}]','[{\"id\": 300103003, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300103003.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300103003.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300103003.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.44\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.87\", \"ebay_price\": \"5.00\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.50\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.49\"}]'),(300103004,'Servants of the Fallen King','Skill Card','skill','Once per turn, you can send 1 Level 3 or lower Zombie Normal Monster from your Deck to the GY. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Bonz',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Scars of Battle\", \"set_code\": \"SBSC-ENS04\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.62\"}]','[{\"id\": 300103004, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300103004.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300103004.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300103004.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.57\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.97\", \"ebay_price\": \"2.50\", \"amazon_price\": \"2.54\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.99\"}]'),(300103005,'Double Evolution Pill (Skill Card)','Skill Card','skill','At the start of your Draw Phase, instead of drawing a card, you can pay 1500 LP to activate this Skill. Banish 1 Dinosaur monster and 1 non-Dinosaur monster from your hand and/or GY; Special Summon 1 Level 7 or higher Dinosaur monster from your hand or Deck, ignoring its Summoning conditions. This Skill can only be used once per Duel. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Rex',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Scars of Battle\", \"set_code\": \"SBSC-ENS05\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"2.27\"}]','[{\"id\": 300103005, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300103005.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300103005.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300103005.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.00\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.00\", \"ebay_price\": \"6.00\", \"amazon_price\": \"2.38\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.00\"}]'),(300104001,'Zombie Master (Skill Card)','Skill Card','skill','Activate this Skill during your Main Phase. Once per Duel, you can choose 1 Level 4 or lower Zombie monster you control, and it gains the following effect while face-up on the field.\r\n● Once per turn: You can send 1 monster from your hand to the GY, then target 1 Level 4 or lower Zombie monster in either GY; Special Summon that target. This monster must be face-up on the field to activate and to resolve this effect.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Bonz',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Trials of the Kingdom\", \"set_code\": \"SBTK-ENS01\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.84\"}]','[{\"id\": 300104001, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300104001.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300104001.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300104001.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.00\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.00\", \"ebay_price\": \"8.00\", \"amazon_price\": \"1.34\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.00\"}]'),(300104002,'Terror from the Deep!','Skill Card','skill','Activate this Skill during your Main Phase, while you control \"Kairyu-Shin\". When this Skill is activated, you can activate \"Umi\" directly from your hand, Deck or GY. While you control \"Kairyu-Shin\", all WATER monsters you control are unaffected by Trap effects. If \"Kairyu-Shin\" you control leaves the field, draw 2 cards, and if you do, flip this card over.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Mako',NULL,NULL,'Umi',NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Trials of the Kingdom\", \"set_code\": \"SBTK-ENS02\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.5\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Trials of the Kingdom Sneak Peek participation cards\", \"set_code\": \"SBTK-ENSP0\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"10.57\"}]','[{\"id\": 300104002, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300104002.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300104002.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300104002.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.89\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.59\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.98\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.79\"}]'),(300104003,'Dino Destruction','Skill Card','skill','Activate this Skill during your Main Phase. Once per turn, you can choose 1 Level 6 or higher Dinosaur monster you control. This turn, if it attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage. Flip this card over at the end of the turn you activated this Skill.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Rex',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Trials of the Kingdom\", \"set_code\": \"SBTK-ENS03\", \"set_rarity\": \"Super Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(SR)\", \"set_price\": \"1.5\"}]','[{\"id\": 300104003, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300104003.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300104003.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300104003.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.42\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"1.11\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.75\", \"amazon_price\": \"2.82\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.39\"}]'),(300104004,'Cocoon of Ultra Evolution (Skill Card)','Skill Card','skill','Activate the following Skill(s) during your Main Phase.\r\n● You can Tribute 1 Insect monster from either field equipped with an Equip Card, and if you do, Special Summon 1 Insect monster from your Deck, ignoring its Summoning conditions, also flip this card over.\r\n● You can shuffle 1 Insect monster from your GY into the Deck, then draw 1 card, also flip this card over.\r\nEach of these Skills can only be used once per Duel.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Weevil',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel Tournament Pack 3\", \"set_code\": \"STP3-ENS01\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"3.89\"}, {\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Trials of the Kingdom\", \"set_code\": \"SBTK-ENS04\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"7.23\"}]','[{\"id\": 300104004, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300104004.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300104004.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300104004.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.00\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.00\", \"ebay_price\": \"6.95\", \"amazon_price\": \"7.99\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.00\"}]'),(300104005,'Switcheroo','Skill Card','skill','Activate this Skill during your Main Phase. Once per turn, you can shuffle 1 card from your hand into the Deck, then draw 1 card, also flip this card over. You can use this Skill up to twice per Duel.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Keith',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel: Trials of the Kingdom\", \"set_code\": \"SBTK-ENS05\", \"set_rarity\": \"Ultra Rare\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(UR)\", \"set_price\": \"2.99\"}]','[{\"id\": 300104005, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300104005.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300104005.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300104005.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"3.91\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"2.47\", \"ebay_price\": \"2.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"6.25\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"2.99\"}]'),(300201001,'Power of Dark','Skill Card','skill','[At the start of the Duel, place this card in your Field Spell Zone and flip it over.] \r\n\r\nAll Fiend and Spellcaster monsters on the field gain 200 ATK/DEF, also all Fairy monsters on the field lose 200 ATK/DEF.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Yugi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel Starter Decks: Destiny Masters\", \"set_code\": \"SS01-ENAS1\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.32\"}]','[{\"id\": 300201001, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300201001.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300201001.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300201001.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.24\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.12\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"1.75\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.49\"}]'),(300201002,'Destiny Draw (Skill Card)','Skill Card','skill','[If you lose 2000 or more LP, you can activate this Skill during your next Draw Phase.]\r\n\r\nDuring your Draw Phase, you may search your Deck for any card, reveal it to your opponent, and add it t