der.\r\nThis Skill can only be used once per Duel.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Ishizu',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel Starter Decks: Destiny Masters\", \"set_code\": \"SS01-ENBS3\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.1\"}]','[{\"id\": 300201006, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300201006.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300201006.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300201006.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.13\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.17\", \"ebay_price\": \"9.00\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.99\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.00\"}]'),(300201007,'It\'s a Toon World!','Skill Card','skill','[At the start of the Duel, place this card in your center Spell & Trap Zone and flip it over.]\r\n\r\nThis card is treated as “Toon World”.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pegasus',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel Starter Decks: Destiny Masters\", \"set_code\": \"SS01-ENCS1\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.22\"}]','[{\"id\": 300201007, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300201007.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300201007.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300201007.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.00\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.40\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"1.09\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.25\"}]'),(300201008,'Mind Scan (Skill Card)','Skill Card','skill','[At the start of the 3rd turn, if your LP is 3000 or higher, activate this Skill (count both players\' turns).]\r\n\r\nYou may look at your opponent\'s Set Spell & Trap Cards at anytime. If your LP drops below 3000, flip this card over. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pegasus',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel Starter Decks: Destiny Masters\", \"set_code\": \"SS01-ENCS2\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"3.24\"}]','[{\"id\": 300201008, \"image_u