this Skill during your next Draw Phase.]\r\n\r\nDuring your Draw Phase, you may search your Deck for a “Harpie” card, reveal it to your opponent, and add it to your hand instead of drawing. If you do that, flip this card over.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Mai',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel Starter Decks: Duelists of Tomorrow\", \"set_code\": \"SS02-ENCS2\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.27\"}]','[{\"id\": 300202008, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300202008.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300202008.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300202008.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.23\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.46\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.57\", \"amazon_price\": \"1.08\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.39\"}]'),(300202009,'Tribal Synergy','Skill Card','skill','[At the start of the Duel, flip this card over.]\r\n\r\nIf you have an “Amazoness” monster and a “Harpie” monster in your hand, reveal them and draw 1 card.\r\n\r\nIf you control an “Amazoness” monster and a “Harpie” monster, draw 2 cards.\r\n\r\nEach of these Skills can only be used once per Duel.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Mai',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel Starter Decks: Duelists of Tomorrow\", \"set_code\": \"SS02-ENCS3\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.07\"}]','[{\"id\": 300202009, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300202009.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300202009.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300202009.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.27\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.17\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.56\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.25\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.49\"}]'),(300203001,'Dinosaur Kingdom','Skill Card','skill','All Dinosaur monsters gain 300 ATK/DEF. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Rex',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel Starter Decks: Ultimate Predators\", \"set_code\": \