ts Summoning conditions. Any damage your opponent takes for the rest of this turn is halved. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Weevil',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel Starter Decks: Ultimate Predators\", \"set_code\": \"SS03-ENBS1\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.05\"}]','[{\"id\": 300203003, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300203003.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300203003.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300203003.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.08\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.06\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.25\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.39\"}]'),(300203004,'Hidden Parasite','Skill Card','skill','Once per turn, you can change all monsters on the field to Insect until the end of this turn, also any battle damage your opponent takes for the rest of this turn is halved. You can only use this Skill up to twice per Duel. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Weevil',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel Starter Decks: Ultimate Predators\", \"set_code\": \"SS03-ENBS2\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.11\"}]','[{\"id\": 300203004, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300203004.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300203004.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300203004.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.07\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.08\", \"ebay_price\": \"0.99\", \"amazon_price\": \"0.25\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.39\"}]'),(300204001,'Ritual of Black Mastery','Skill Card','skill','[Flip this card over when you activate this Skill.]\r\n\r\nActivate this Skill during your Main Phase, while you control \"Black Luster Soldier\" or \"Magician of Black Chaos\" that you Ritual Summoned this turn.\r\n● While you control \"Black Luster Soldier\", it cannot be destroyed by your opponent\'s Skill, also once per turn, if your opponent activates a Trap Card, draw 1 card immediately after it resolves.\r\n● While you control \"Magician of Black Chaos\", it cannot be destroyed by your opponent\'s Spell effects, also if your \"Magician of Black Chaos\" destroys a monster by battle, add 1 Spell from your GY to your hand.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Yami Yugi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel Starter Decks: Match of the Millennium\", \"set_code\": \"SS04-ENS01\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.28\"}]','[{\"id\": 300204001, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300204001.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300204001.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300204001.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.31\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.21\", \"ebay_price\": \"1.49\", \"amazon_price\": \"4.79\", \"coolstuffinc_price\": \"0.39\"}]'),(300204002,'Knight of Legend','Skill Card','skill','[Flip this card over when you activate this Skill.]\r\n\r\nActivate this Skill during your Main Phase. Each turn, 1 \"Gaia The Fierce Knight\" you Normal Summon can be Summoned without Tributing. Apply the following Skills while you control a \"Gaia The Fierce Knight\" monster or a \"Gaia the Dragon Champion\" monster.\r\n● If it attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage. Once per turn, if it inflicts battle damage with this Skill, draw 2 cards, then discard 1 card.\r\n● You cannot activate Set cards in the Spell & Trap Zone.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Yami Yugi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'null','[{\"set_name\": \"Speed Duel Starter Decks: Match of the Millennium\", \"set_code\": \"SS04-ENS02\", \"set_rarity\": \"Common\", \"set_rarity_code\": \"(C)\", \"set_price\": \"1.28\"}]','[{\"id\": 300204002, \"image_url\": \"../images/cards/300204002.jpg\", \"image_url_small\": \"../images/cards_small/300204002.jpg\", \"image_url_cropped\": \"../images/cards_cropped/300204002.jpg\"}]','[{\"cardmarket_price\": \"0.09\", \"tcgplayer_price\": \"0.28\", \"ebay_pri